@startuml
title Frontend selection and query cache
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Open season configuration;
:Load season configuration and catalogs;
:Select sport and division tabs;
:Enable team and game queries for selected division;
:Select team tab;
:Enable roster query for selected team;
if (Administrator can edit roster?) then (yes)
  :Enable available-player query;
else (no)
  :Show read-only roster;
endif
:Reuse fresh cached data while switching tabs;
if (Relevant mutation or Refresh data?) then (yes)
  :Invalidate affected queries and reload active data;
else (no)
  :Reuse data until it becomes stale;
  :Later selection, page return, or refocus may refetch;
endif
stop
legend bottom
  Freshness is one minute, not a polling timer.
  Hidden panels stay mounted to preserve drafts,
  but their queries are disabled.
endlegend
@enduml
